{"id": "86010", "name": "לינאריות האינטגרל – סכום של שני סינוסים (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Integrate {{CT:0}} with respect to {{CT:1}}.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Linearity of the integral</b><br><div style=\"background:#FFF8E6;border:1px solid #E8D29A;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;margin:12px 0\">Linearity: \\( \\int (af(x)+bg(x))\\,dx=a\\int f(x)\\,dx+b\\int g(x)\\,dx \\)</div>To solve this problem we will have to use the linearity rules for integration as follows:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\begin{aligned} \\int [{{CT:2}}] d{{CT:3}} &= \\int {{CT:4}} d{{CT:3}} + \\int {{CT:5}} d{{CT:3}} \\\\ &= {{CT:6}}\\int {{CT:7}} d{{CT:3}} + {{CT:8}}\\int {{CT:9}} d{{CT:3}} \\\\ &= {{CT:6}}\\left[{{CT:10}}\\right] + {{CT:8}}\\left[{{CT:11}}\\right] + c \\\\ &= {{CT:12}} + c \\end{aligned} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect'>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "q:ppp1+ppp2;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "Int", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "int(p,v)+c", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "diff(ans1,v)", "tans": "-p", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Your answer is the negative of the expected result. The integral of \\(\\sin(x)\\) is \\(-\\cos(x)\\).  Have you forgotten this sign?</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "diff(ans1,v)", "tans": "q", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-3-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">You appear to have used {@q@} as the integrand and forgotten the constant coefficients {{CT:13}} and {{CT:14}}.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-3-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["p", "pp1", "pp2", "ppp1", "ppp2", "rdm1", "rdm2", "v"], "nvariants": 4}